      "source": "https://www.ipcc.ch/report/ar6/wg1/chapter/chapter-9/"
    },
    {
      "claim": "Much of Kuttanad's paddy land is kayal land that farmers reclaimed from Vembanad lake.",
      "working": "Kayal reclamation, 1880s-1940s, is the standard history of Kuttanad.",
      "source": "https://ras.org.in/articles/321/text/article.html"
    }
